From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 16:14:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: sever ACP agent registry network fetch (offline-only)

The strace air-gap smoke caught the last unsolicited boot-time egress:
AgentRegistryStore::init_global fetched the Agent Client Protocol registry
index from https://cdn.agentclientprotocol.com/registry/v1/latest/registry.json
(and downloaded agent icons from raw.githubusercontent.com) on first launch,
before any user action.

Make the registry offline-only, matching the extension-registry freeze in
patch 0016. Delete the remote-fetch surface entirely (strip-by-deletion):
REGISTRY_URL, fetch_registry_index, download_icon, fetch_url_body, refresh,
refresh_if_stale, the is_fetching/fetch_error/pending_refresh/last_refresh
state, and the resolve_icon_* helpers. The store now loads agents only from
the on-disk cache (paths::external_agents_dir()/registry/registry.json), which
is populated solely by placing a file there - never over the network.

Update the callers that drove the fetch: AgentServerStore::settings_changed,
custom agent launch, the agent_ui registry-page action, and the registry UI
empty/error state. The registry page now shows a static "No agents available"
instead of a connection-error/retry path.

Replace the network-only test suite (timeout / icon-download concurrency,
which can no longer happen) with one offline guard test: init_global with a
FakeHttpClient that panics on any request must leave the store empty and make
zero requests - so a rebase that re-adds a boot-time fetch fails the test.

init_global keeps its http_client parameter (now unused) to avoid churning
the shared call sites, including the remote_server binary the build gate does
not compile.

Verified: cargo build --package zed green; the offline guard test passes; and
a fresh strace -f -e trace=connect,network run on a Plasma Wayland session
(open a file, idle 33s, quit) shows zero non-loopback connect()/sendto and
zero DNS - only loopback IPC (crash-handler :1234, Ollama probe :11434).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
